# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — SYNTAX ACADEMY
## Complete Professional Online Learning Management Platform

Act as a Senior Full-Stack Software Engineer, UI/UX Designer, Database Architect, Security Engineer, and QA Engineer.

Your mission is to BUILD a complete, production-ready online learning platform for **Syntax Academy**, a programming and technology education academy.

This is a real educational business platform, not a demo, prototype, or static landing page.

You must implement all features with functional frontend interfaces, real database operations, authentication, authorization, validation, and proper error handling.

Do not create fake buttons, simulated functionality, hardcoded dashboard statistics, or frontend-only features.

